00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:55.290
Wow, she's huge!

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.290
Wait, wait, wait!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.580
What are you doing?!

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:00.290
Oh, so then you'll pay attention to me?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.750
No, that isn't it!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.170
Stop being excessively involved with us!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.540
Oh my.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:08.040
The reason you think that
this is too excessively involved,

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.460
is because your relationship is weak, isn't it?

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.630
Wh-what do you mean?

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.920
So that's why...

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.580
If you two had a more intense relationship,

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.250
you wouldn't even notice that I'm involved, right?

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.500
If you would just restrain yourself,

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.500
this conversation would be over!

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.670
I see, a more intense relationship...

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:25.710
Kosaka-san?!

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.430
Don't get any strange influences, okay?!

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.290
...is what I expressly told her.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:35.290
But I guess it's because Kosaka is docile.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:38.630
I wish she hadn't started being so intense...

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.830
The gym's storage room?

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.170
I can't believe I'm waiting in a place like this...

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.710
There's no way...

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.460
I hope she's not thinking of something extreme.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.500
Shinozaki-san...

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.960
Oh no, of course not...

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.840
Big Bro-bro, come and get down on your knees!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:05.020
Big Bro-bro, come and get down on your knees!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.650
Come on!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.810
You're overthinking it.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:13.790
I'm sorry.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:18.000
I assumed you would like one of these, but...

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.290
You prepared for this really well, huh...

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.080
How about this electric shock machine?

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:25.920
Go ahead, apply it to me wherever you please.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.250
No, that's not what I want!

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:39.170
Oh dear, there's a sexy book in Shinozaki-san's bag...

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:42.040
No, didn't you just put that there yourself?

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.080
Honestly.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:46.710
Isn't there something
you would like me to do instead of a book?

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.040
Uh, huh?

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.210
As your girlfriend, at least these contents cou-

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:56.290
It seems a bit more studying is necessary...

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:59.210
That was more intense than you bargained for, huh?

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:13.540
I have to hurry and make
this relationship more intense...

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:19.750
Once again, I've fluctuated towards
Ariyama-senpai's behaviors!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:32.000
Right. Now that is intense!

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:34.830
Uh, hey, Kosaka-san...

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.540
I'm sorry...

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.710
I've caused you so much trouble.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.750
Oh no, I'm fine!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.580
You did surprise me, though.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:57.500
I... fluctuate so quickly...

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:01.960
And I still haven't grasped
your particular inclinations...

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:05.920
As a girlfriend, I'm still inexperienced.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:08.080
D-don't worry about that!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:12.330
I can see that you're always doing your very best!

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:14.380
Shinozaki-san...

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:17.710
So just that is enough!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.290
You don't have to worry about what Shizuku says.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:35.210
Whether an intense relationship is good or not
is something that we decide.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.000
You're right...

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:41.080
I feel kind of relieved.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.830
With something like that,
when we become even closer as lovers...

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:48.000
I feel like that will resolve itself in due time.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:48.710
Right.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:50.040
And so...

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.960
Let's continue to get along...

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.080
Haru-kun.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:05.880
I thought that using a familiar tone
would be good to deepen our relationship...

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:09.040
but you pulled away as expected, so I'll stop.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.830
No! That...

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.880
That isn't it...

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:02.920
So you don't prefer "Pig"
over "Haru-kun" after all, huh?

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:05.670
I told you, I'm not an M...

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:10.790
It's really pouring.

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:13.330
I'm soaki- sopping wet.

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:14.790
Why did you change what you said?

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:18.170
Shinozaki-san, let's take shelter from the rain here!

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:21.670
Huh?! This is a hotel for couples
to have exciting times at!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:23.330
It's abbreviated as 'exciho' right?!

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:24.960
Isn't that a very bad idea?!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.710
Right now all other establishments
besides the exciho are full

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:31.080
due to the entrances being bombarded by rain,
so there are no other options but this!

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:33.790
Something about your explanation
seems kinda suspect, but...

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:37.170
I guess all we can do is... go into the exciho...
